WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.717
Predict and test an event using repeated fair trials. Record all results and compare

00:00:05.717 --> 00:00:06.899
the observed frequencies.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.583
Which is more likely: red (10) or blue (6) bottle tops? The answer is red. Compare

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:14.719
the counts; 10 red versus 6 blue.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.844
A bag during a reading competition has 8 red and 8 blue bottle tops. Which colour is

00:00:20.844 --> 00:00:24.280
more likely on one random draw? Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.117 --> 00:00:30.829
A bag during a reading competition has 8 red and 8 blue bottle tops. Which colour is

00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:35.869
more likely on one random draw? The answer is equally likely. Compare the counts; 8

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.213
red versus 8 blue.
